{
  "version": "0.1.2",
  "slug": "expanding-toolbar",
  "title": "Expanding toolbar",
  "group": "Microinteractions",
  "order": 8,
  "summary": {
    "en": "A compact row of icon tools where the hovered or focused one opens its label and one highlight glides to it. The default tool shows its label at rest, so the bar is never a row of unexplained icons.",
    "id": "Deretan ringkas alat berikon; alat yang sedang di-hover atau difokus membuka labelnya dan satu sorotan meluncur ke sana. Alat bawaan menampilkan labelnya saat diam, jadi bilah ini tidak pernah berupa deretan ikon tanpa penjelasan."
  },
  "titleId": "Expanding toolbar",
  "react": false,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Note actions",
        "desc": "Hover or Tab across the tools: each label opens as the highlight travels straight to where the button will end up. Leave the bar and Edit opens again.",
        "html": "<div class=\"xbar\" data-lds-toolbar role=\"toolbar\" aria-label=\"Note actions\">\n  <span class=\"xbar__hl\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n  <button class=\"xbar__btn is-open\" aria-label=\"Edit\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">edit</span><span class=\"xbar__label\"><span>Edit</span></span></button><button class=\"xbar__btn\" aria-label=\"Duplicate\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">content_copy</span><span class=\"xbar__label\"><span>Duplicate</span></span></button><button class=\"xbar__btn\" aria-label=\"Share\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">share</span><span class=\"xbar__label\"><span>Share</span></span></button><button class=\"xbar__btn\" aria-label=\"Delete\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">delete</span><span class=\"xbar__label\"><span>Delete</span></span></button>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Grouped tools for a picture",
        "desc": "A separator splits arranging tools from sharing. The highlight skips the separator.",
        "html": "<div class=\"xbar\" data-lds-toolbar role=\"toolbar\" aria-label=\"Picture tools\">\n  <span class=\"xbar__hl\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n  <button class=\"xbar__btn is-open\" aria-label=\"Align left\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">format_align_left</span><span class=\"xbar__label\"><span>Align left</span></span></button><button class=\"xbar__btn\" aria-label=\"Center\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">format_align_center</span><span class=\"xbar__label\"><span>Center</span></span></button><button class=\"xbar__btn\" aria-label=\"Align right\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">format_align_right</span><span class=\"xbar__label\"><span>Align right</span></span></button>\n  <span class=\"xbar__sep\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n  <button class=\"xbar__btn\" aria-label=\"Download\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">download</span><span class=\"xbar__label\"><span>Download</span></span></button><button class=\"xbar__btn\" aria-label=\"Share\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">share</span><span class=\"xbar__label\"><span>Share</span></span></button>\n</div>"
      }
    ],
    "id": [
      {
        "title": "Aksi catatan",
        "desc": "Arahkan kursor atau tekan Tab melewati alat-alatnya: setiap label terbuka saat sorotan meluncur langsung ke posisi akhir tombol. Tinggalkan bilah dan Ubah terbuka lagi.",
        "html": "<div class=\"xbar\" data-lds-toolbar role=\"toolbar\" aria-label=\"Aksi catatan\">\n  <span class=\"xbar__hl\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n  <button class=\"xbar__btn is-open\" aria-label=\"Ubah\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">edit</span><span class=\"xbar__label\"><span>Ubah</span></span></button><button class=\"xbar__btn\" aria-label=\"Duplikat\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">content_copy</span><span class=\"xbar__label\"><span>Duplikat</span></span></button><button class=\"xbar__btn\" aria-label=\"Bagikan\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">share</span><span class=\"xbar__label\"><span>Bagikan</span></span></button><button class=\"xbar__btn\" aria-label=\"Hapus\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">delete</span><span class=\"xbar__label\"><span>Hapus</span></span></button>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Alat berkelompok untuk gambar",
        "desc": "Pemisah membagi alat penataan dari alat berbagi. Sorotan melewati pemisah.",
        "html": "<div class=\"xbar\" data-lds-toolbar role=\"toolbar\" aria-label=\"Alat gambar\">\n  <span class=\"xbar__hl\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n  <button class=\"xbar__btn is-open\" aria-label=\"Rata kiri\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">format_align_left</span><span class=\"xbar__label\"><span>Rata kiri</span></span></button><button class=\"xbar__btn\" aria-label=\"Tengah\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">format_align_center</span><span class=\"xbar__label\"><span>Tengah</span></span></button><button class=\"xbar__btn\" aria-label=\"Rata kanan\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">format_align_right</span><span class=\"xbar__label\"><span>Rata kanan</span></span></button>\n  <span class=\"xbar__sep\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n  <button class=\"xbar__btn\" aria-label=\"Unduh\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">download</span><span class=\"xbar__label\"><span>Unduh</span></span></button><button class=\"xbar__btn\" aria-label=\"Bagikan\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">share</span><span class=\"xbar__label\"><span>Bagikan</span></span></button>\n</div>"
      }
    ]
  },
  "related": [
    "toggle",
    "icon-button",
    "sliding-indicator",
    "selection-bar"
  ]
}
